+
+Frigate re-handshakes on its own; the `.mnn` conversion cache is already in `models/`.
+Caveat from Phase 1: with one 10 ms control stream per inference, batch mode is
+time-sliced against other GPU work (Frigate's Vulkan scalers, other benchmarks), so its
+tail latency under heavy GPU contention is higher than direct mode's even though the
+median is far lower; Frigate's 200 ms timeout leaves >5x margin (max seen 39.8 ms).
